FRONTEND:

The frontend uses the React Library to manage the navigation and rendering. Mainly using this due to familiarity as well as this website probably not being too big, it working to make this into an SPA.

Core Tools:
1. React is the library I am using to create components and give the site life
2. Vite is the build tool and dev server I use to test and make the code runable on a browser
3. ESLint is the tool I use for a general consistency and quality check of my code
4. Tailwind is the CSS framework I use to customize the site how I designed it in my Figma 
5. Git is the source control tool I am using to save and deploy my work
6. Github actions is the general instructions that Github pages follows to deploy the site


